WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.981
Review sheet.

2
00:00:01.261 --> 00:00:03.651
The gradient has the shape of its variable.

3
00:00:03.931 --> 00:00:09.648
Broadcasting in the forward pass becomes summing in the backward pass, and summing becomes broadcasting.

4
00:00:09.928 --> 00:00:19.080
Linear layer: dW = X transpose dY, dX = dY W transpose, db = column sums of dY.

5
00:00:19.360 --> 00:00:22.453
tanh: multiply by 1 minus the squared output.

6
00:00:22.733 --> 00:00:24.824
Embedding: scatter-add into rows.

7
00:00:25.104 --> 00:00:30.117
Batched cross-entropy: (softmax minus one-hot) over N, rows summing to zero.

8
00:00:30.397 --> 00:00:38.333
BatchNorm’s backward projects out the shift and scale directions; Bessel’s correction adds an n over (n minus 1) factor.

9
00:00:38.613 --> 00:00:41.323
Gradient-check everything on random inputs.

10
00:00:41.603 --> 00:00:45.187
Next week: attention, the transformer, and the tokenizer.
